    "*** Blockade / disruption ***": "Blockade / disruption:\nMovement or a site is blocked by people. Roads, buildings, ports, or a strike. Not a cyber outage.",
    "*** Public order ***": "Public order:\nPolice or custody operations, or unrest at a jail, prison, or courthouse.",
    "*** Coordinated / other sites ***": "Coordinated / other sites:\nBorder, election, meeting, convoy, business shutdown, or an organized social-media campaign. Not a street riot and not a cyberattack on list 3."
